// Settings -> Providers screen & Add provider 3-step modal wizard.
// Mirrors T3 Code's Providers settings layout and full Antigravity multi-instance controls:
//   - Breadcrumb header (Settings / Providers) + close button
//   - Scope context bar (Applying settings for [All projects v] on [Host v])
//   - Providers + header and Checked <age> refresh control
//   - Master-detail split card: left provider list with status dot, 2-line summary, blue pill switch,
//     and + Add provider row; right independently scrollable detail pane with Status, Display name
//     (+ accent picker), Setup (Environment, Runtime, Account + inline OAuth card), Runtime
//     (Sign-in method dropdown, API key, GCP project, GCP location, Binary path), Environment
//     (Variables + Add variable), and Models (Favorites / All / Hidden, star, reorder, toggles).
//   - 3-step Add provider modal wizard (1 Provider -> 2 Identity -> 3 Config).

// ---- Constants ----

CP_PS_MAX_INST :: 12;
CP_PS_MAX_ENV :: 16;
CP_PS_MAX_MODELS :: 32;
CP_PS_ACCENTS :: 8;

CP_PS_DRV_ANTIGRAVITY :: 0;
CP_PS_DRV_CLAUDE :: 1;
CP_PS_DRV_CODEX :: 2;
CP_PS_DRV_CURSOR :: 3;
CP_PS_DRV_ACP :: 4;
CP_PS_DRV_COUNT :: 5;

CP_PS_ST_DISABLED :: 0;
CP_PS_ST_READY :: 1;
CP_PS_ST_WARNING :: 2;
CP_PS_ST_ERROR :: 3;

CP_PS_AUTH_PERSONAL :: 0;
CP_PS_AUTH_BUSINESS :: 1;
CP_PS_AUTH_API_KEY :: 2;
CP_PS_AUTH_VERTEX :: 3;
